00:44:54,532 --> 00:44:54,822
なんてこった てんでバラバラ ちんぷんかんぷん
What the heck, bang holler guffaw!

531
00:44:57,492 --> 00:44:57,802
まとまんない
It doesn't get settled!

532
00:45:00,406 --> 00:45:01,286
Welcome to ようこそジャパリパーク！
Welcome to Japari Park!

533
00:45:01,456 --> 00:45:04,536
今日も ドッタンバッタン 大騒ぎ
Today is also full of commotion!

534
00:45:04,806 --> 00:45:05,616
うー！ がうー！
Grrr, roar!

535
00:45:05,816 --> 00:45:07,736
高らかに 笑い笑えば フレンズ
Laugh loudly and we're friends,

536
00:45:07,886 --> 00:45:10,616
喧騒して すっちゃかめちゃかしてても 仲良し
even if we make a ruckus, we're best friends.

537
00:45:10,816 --> 00:45:11,406
はい、どうぞ
Here we go!

538
00:45:12,676 --> 00:45:15,276
Nice to meet you ジャパリパーク！
Nice to meet you at Japari Park!

539
00:45:15,276 --> 00:45:17,596
今日からは どうぞ よろしくね
Please treat us well starting today!

540
00:45:17,916 --> 00:45:21,136
いつもいつでも 優しい笑顔 君を待っていたの
Always waiting for you with a tender smile.

541
00:45:21,476 --> 00:45:24,116
開かれた 扉 夢をいっぱい語ったら
Once we open the door and talk about our dreams,

542
00:45:29,336 --> 00:45:32,576
どこまでも どこまでも 続いてく
it will continue on and on, anywhere,

543
00:45:32,896 --> 00:45:35,096
グレートジャーニー
our great journey.

544
00:45:53,496 --> 00:45:56,396
東へ 吠えろ 西へ 吠えろ
Howl to the east, howl to the west,

545
00:45:56,716 --> 00:46:05,316
世界中に 響け サファリメロディ
sound the safari melody all over the world!

546
00:46:09,016 --> 00:46:10,196
Welcome to ようこそ ジャパリパーク！
Welcome to Japari Park!

547
00:46:10,316 --> 00:46:13,316
今日も ドッタンバッタン 大騒ぎ
Today is also full of commotion!

548
00:46:13,896 --> 00:46:17,056
姿形も 十人十色 だから 魅かれ合うの
Everyone is unique, which is why we're drawn to each other.

549
00:46:21,396 --> 00:46:25,196
夕暮れ空に 指をそっと重ねたら
When we softly overlap our fingers in the twilight sky,

550
00:46:25,496 --> 00:46:31,696
はじめまして 君をもっと知りたいな
nice to meet you, I want to know more about you.

551
00:46:32,696 --> 00:46:33,896
うー！ がうー！
Grrr, roar!

552
00:46:34,396 --> 00:46:40,116
ララララ… Oh, welcome to the Japari park!
La la la... Oh, welcome to the Japari Park!

553
00:46:40,396 --> 00:46:45,496
ララララ… 集まれ 友達
La la la... Gather around, friends!

554
00:46:48,496 --> 00:46:50,696
Oh, welcome to the Japari park!

555
00:46:54,316 --> 00:46:56,796
素敵な 旅立ち
A wonderful journey,

556
00:46:56,976 --> 00:46:59,936
ようこそ ジャパリパーク！
welcome to Japari Park!

557
00:47:10,271 --> 00:47:13,661
あらゆる困難が科学で解決するこの平成の時代
In this Heisei era where all hardships are solved by science,

558
00:47:14,161 --> 00:47:17,661
人々の閉ざされた心の闇に蔓延る
rampant in the closed-off darkness of people's hearts,

559
00:47:17,661 --> 00:47:19,961
魑魅魍魎が 存在していた
monsters and spirits existed.

560
00:47:20,261 --> 00:47:24,161
科学の力ではどうしようも出来ないその奇奇怪怪な妖怪に立ち向かう
Facing those bizarre apparitions that science couldn't handle,

561
00:47:24,561 --> 00:47:28,161
神妙不可思議にて胡散臭い男がひとり
stands one mysterious, uncanny, and shady man.

562
00:47:29,761 --> 00:47:32,161
その名は 矢部野彦麿
His name is Hikomaro Yabeno.

563
00:47:33,361 --> 00:47:36,661
そう 人は彼を陰陽師と呼ぶ
Yes, people call him an Onmyoji—

564
00:47:38,161 --> 00:47:40,961
悪霊退散！悪霊退散！
Exorcise evil spirits! Exorcise evil spirits!

565
00:47:41,361 --> 00:47:47,961
怨霊 ものの怪 困った時は ドーマン！セーマン！ドーマン！セーマン！
When troubled by vengeful spirits and phantoms, Doman! Seeman! Doman! Seeman!

566
00:47:48,261 --> 00:47:50,961
直ぐに呼びましょう陰陽師 レッツゴー！
Call the Onmyoji right away, let's go!

567
00:48:04,261 --> 00:48:06,961
死してなお この世に未練残せしは
Those who leave behind attachments to this world even in death,

568
00:48:07,261 --> 00:48:10,661
魑魅魍魎と成り果て その悪しき血を清めるが
turning into ghouls and spirits, to purify that evil blood—

569
00:48:14,961 --> 00:48:16,161
陰陽の道
the path of Yin and Yang!

570
00:48:16,261 --> 00:48:20,161
人の世に生まれし悪を闇にへと葬れよ
Banish the evil born in the world of men into the darkness!

571
00:48:42,261 --> 00:48:45,161
悪霊退散！悪霊退散！
Exorcise evil spirits! Exorcise evil spirits!

572
00:48:45,261 --> 00:48:51,661
妖怪 あやかし 困った時は ドーマン！セーマン！ドーマン！セーマン！
When troubled by specters and apparitions, Doman! Seeman! Doman! Seeman!

573
00:48:51,961 --> 00:48:55,161
助けてもらおう陰陽師 レッツゴー！
Let's ask the Onmyoji for help, let's go!

574
00:49:07,361 --> 00:49:12,661
生きながら 怨み惜しみ 妬りしは 悪鬼悪霊
Those who harbor resentment and jealousy while alive are evil demons and spirits.

575
00:49:13,161 --> 00:49:17,661
呼び覚ます その激昂を宥めるも
To soothe that awakening rage—

576
00:49:18,161 --> 00:49:21,161
陰陽の道 愛しさの
the path of Yin and Yang, of love...

577
00:49:26,261 --> 00:49:32,161
行き着く果てに 病む魂
At the end of the journey, a sick soul

578
00:49:39,261 --> 00:49:45,161
慰めよ 悪鬼悪霊
be comforted, evil demons and spirits!

579
00:49:46,261 --> 00:49:49,161
悪霊退散！悪霊退散！
Exorcise evil spirits! Exorcise evil spirits!

580
00:49:49,261 --> 00:49:55,661
怨念 怨恨 困った時は ドーマン！セーマン！ドーマン！セーマン！
When troubled by grudges and spite, Doman! Seeman! Doman! Seeman!

581
00:49:55,961 --> 00:49:59,161
鎮めてもらおう陰陽師 レッツゴー！
Have the Onmyoji pacify them, let's go!

582
00:50:28,316 --> 00:50:31,426
辛い時 悲しい時は
When things are tough, when you're sad,

583
00:50:31,426 --> 00:50:34,596
人はそんな時 心の隙間に闇ができる
that's when darkness forms in the gaps of people's hearts.

584
00:50:34,676 --> 00:50:40,526
その心の闇に魔物達は容赦なく入り込んでくるのだ！
Into the darkness of that heart, monsters ruthlessly come creeping in!

585
00:50:40,576 --> 00:50:43,226
だから苦しくてもくじけるな！
So even if it's painful, don't give up!

586
00:50:43,226 --> 00:50:44,926
落ち込むな！
Don't get down!

587
00:50:44,926 --> 00:50:47,276
くよくよするな！
Don't fret!

588
00:50:47,476 --> 00:50:53,326
何事にも屈しない強靭な心こそが最強の武器なのだから！
Because an indomitable heart that yields to nothing is your strongest weapon!

589
00:50:59,526 --> 00:51:04,376
ゆらめく心
Wavering hearts...

590
00:51:04,376 --> 00:51:11,176
心を狙うもの 打ち砕け！
Smash those who target the heart!

591
00:51:20,326 --> 00:51:24,126
悪霊退散！悪霊退散！
Begone, evil spirits! Begone, evil spirits!

592
00:51:24,276 --> 00:51:29,976
超常現象 困った時は ドーマン！セーマン！ドーマン！セーマン！
When troubled by supernatural phenomena, Doman! Seeman! Doman! Seeman!

593
00:51:30,176 --> 00:51:36,176
祓ってもらおう 陰陽師 レッツゴー！悪霊退散！悪霊退散！
Let's have them exorcised by an Onmyoji, Let's Go! Begone, evil spirits!

594
00:51:36,476 --> 00:51:42,976
呪い呪われ 困った時は ドーマン！セーマン！ドーマン！セーマン！
When troubled by curses and being cursed, Doman! Seeman! Doman! Seeman!

595
00:51:43,176 --> 00:51:49,176
相談しましょう 陰陽師 レッツゴー！やっぱり頼れる 陰陽師 レッツゴー！
Let's consult an Onmyoji, Let's Go! As expected, you can rely on an Onmyoji, Let's Go!

596
00:51:49,476 --> 00:51:54,176
みんなのヒーロー 陰！陽！師！
Everyone's hero, Yin! Yang! Master!

597
00:52:22,176 --> 00:52:26,176
成仏しろよ！
Rest in peace!

598
00:52:42,476 --> 00:52:45,526
BAW BAW! Hi guys!

599
00:52:45,526 --> 00:52:51,226
Welcome to our birthday party together with us, right?

600
00:52:51,226 --> 00:52:57,826
You know, we have some of our holodog senpai joining us right here.

601
00:52:57,826 --> 00:53:03,376
Welcome to "Yappari! Party", an extra special version of "Let's Go! Onmyoji", right?

602
00:53:03,376 --> 00:53:08,676
What was that with the bells and the microphone?

603
00:53:08,676 --> 00:53:13,976
Well, you know, that's the necessary part of "Let's Go! Onmyoji", right?

604
00:53:13,976 --> 00:53:15,176
I guess.

605
00:53:15,176 --> 00:53:21,176
We're just so happy to have a bunch of our friends here with us for a big birthday live today.

606
00:53:21,176 --> 00:53:26,676
It's been really special so far, huh? Yeah!

607
00:53:26,676 --> 00:53:32,676
But, but, we're still not done! We've got another surprise for you.

608
00:53:32,676 --> 00:53:36,676
What? Is the fun time already over, though? No, not time, right?

609
00:53:36,676 --> 00:53:47,176
Yeah! Well, Ruffians, you know, it's our special day today, but actually, we have something we'd like to surprise you with!

610
00:53:47,176 --> 00:53:55,176
Are you ready? Okay, then drumroll. Okay. 3, 2, 1!

611
00:53:56,176 --> 00:54:09,676
Our birthday merch today! Here we have a FUWAMOCO birthday set and MOCOCO birthday set.

612
00:54:10,176 --> 00:54:17,676
Well, this year's birthday merch is a little bit embarrassing.

613
00:54:17,676 --> 00:54:27,176
I'm sure it's going to be okay, Fuwawa. It's going to be okay. I know a lot of Ruffians have been waiting for a long time for something like this, but...

614
00:54:27,176 --> 00:54:35,176
Ta-da! Here we have the definitive FUWAMOCO dakimakura cover!

615
00:54:35,176 --> 00:54:47,176
But in a way, right, you know, Ruffians, you can't just have Fuwawa on one side and me on the other, okay? That's not okay. Got it?

616
00:54:47,176 --> 00:55:00,056
Yeah! So that's why we have a Fuwawa version and a Mococo version! Of course with a beautiful illustration, but I love...

617
00:55:00,870 --> 00:55:05,330
Fuwamoco Birthday merchandise is finally here!

618
00:55:07,320 --> 00:55:10,160
This is the Fuwawa Dakimakura!

619
00:55:11,160 --> 00:55:15,740
And here is the Mococo Dakimakura!

620
00:55:16,400 --> 00:55:20,740
The body pillow is embarrassing, but...

621
00:55:21,400 --> 00:55:25,240
We hope that we can help you sleep soundly

622
00:55:25,240 --> 00:55:30,000
at night, you know!

623
00:55:31,540 --> 00:55:36,760
Fuwawa hugging version, and Mococo hugging version!

624
00:55:40,260 --> 00:55:44,120
Even though it might be a little bit embarrassing,

625
00:55:44,440 --> 00:55:47,580
we hope that we can help you sleep soundly at night!

626
00:55:48,560 --> 00:55:53,500
Fuwawa & Mococo Hugging Body Pillow Cover!

627
00:55:55,320 --> 00:56:00,080
And next, we have Fuwawa Plushie Keychain!

628
00:56:00,320 --> 00:56:04,160
Mococo Plushie Keychain, compact size!

629
00:56:05,320 --> 00:56:09,280
Fuwawa Mascot can go anywhere, and anywhere along with you!

630
00:56:10,160 --> 00:56:13,820
Attached to your bag, maybe your keys,

631
00:56:14,080 --> 00:56:16,440
maybe even your car!

632
00:56:17,300 --> 00:56:20,700
No matter what, we'll be by your side, and super cute!

633
00:56:21,680 --> 00:56:26,100
And next, we have a very cute Fuwawa Headband and Mococo Headband!

634
00:56:27,340 --> 00:56:30,320
Maybe you're wondering, what exactly is this?

635
00:56:31,080 --> 00:56:36,340
Well, this way we can help keep back the fluff in the face

636
00:56:36,340 --> 00:56:39,340
when you wash your face at night!

637
00:56:39,840 --> 00:56:44,400
Or maybe you can just have fun with a quick Fuwamoskyle disguise!

638
00:56:50,280 --> 00:56:51,580
And finally, we have some cute collectible Button Badges of Fuwawa and Mococo!

639
00:56:52,680 --> 00:56:57,860
That's sparkly and holographic, and come in a super cute heart shape!

640
00:56:58,940 --> 00:57:04,760
It's perfect for any ita-bags, you know, just bringing a bit more Fuwamoco to your belongings!

641
00:57:07,140 --> 00:57:11,980
But uh, well, we also have something special as well, right Mococo?

642
00:57:11,980 --> 00:57:17,880
Something more special! Yeah, you know what would help you get an even better rest at night, right?

643
00:57:21,280 --> 00:57:30,040
Voice pack! A soothing Sleepover with Fuwawa ASMR voice, and a soothing Sleepover with Mococo ASMR voice!

644
00:57:32,640 --> 00:57:36,600
But we hope that you'll listen to both of them right before bed!

645
00:57:39,140 --> 00:57:46,600
And finally, for fans who purchase the entire set, we also have a special thank you bonus voice message as well!

646
00:57:47,100 --> 00:57:50,180
And of course, there are also special hand-signed limited edition sets!

647
00:57:50,540 --> 00:57:54,280
That come with a Polaroid-style card! Wow, so cute!

648
00:57:55,300 --> 00:57:59,280
We really hope that you'll be able to get your paws on them as well, ruffians!

649
00:58:04,380 --> 00:58:15,740
And as a full set bonus, you'll receive one card that can be used in the Hololive Official Card Game! One card for Fuwawa's set, one card for Mococo's set!

650
00:58:16,680 --> 00:58:22,280
And this card is only available to those who purchase from the Hololive Production official shop!

651
00:58:22,680 --> 00:58:25,900
Okay, got it? Please look forward to it, okay?

652
00:58:30,320 --> 00:58:33,520
You know, after that very exciting announcement...

653
00:58:33,991 --> 00:58:39,991
We still have one last song we'd like to sing for you today!

654
00:58:40,680 --> 00:58:47,540
This next song is one that's really important to us, especially when we were still locked up back in the cell.

655
00:58:48,280 --> 00:58:55,520
And now that we're finally a part of Hololive, and you know, we're even able to have our first ever birthday live!

656
00:58:56,000 --> 00:59:01,191
We'd like to sing it for you, okay? Please listen. Kirameki Rider☆!

657
00:59:08,715 --> 00:59:12,915
生まれたてのドキドキを響かせよう
Let's make our newborn heartbeats echo!

658
00:59:13,395 --> 00:59:16,935
最高の時間 最高の仲間と
With the best time and the best friends,

659
00:59:17,295 --> 00:59:20,375
キラメキに乗って☆
Riding on the sparkle☆

660
00:59:20,855 --> 00:59:22,255
イエーイ！
Yay!

661
00:59:31,534 --> 00:59:35,224
覚えてるかな 最初の一曲
Do you remember our very first song?

662
00:59:35,444 --> 00:59:39,944
私声が震えていた (ほんの少し)
My voice was trembling (just a little bit).

663
00:59:40,184 --> 00:59:46,524
あの日から続く未来は みんなと掴んだ今日だよ
The future that started from that day is today we seized together with everyone!

664
00:59:47,204 --> 00:59:50,784
もっともっともっともっと 加速するハート
More and more, my heart accelerates!

665
00:59:51,004 --> 00:59:54,684
(いっしょに) 行くよどこまでも
(Together) Let's go anywhere!

666
00:59:54,864 --> 00:59:56,684
(are you ready?) 準備はOK？
(Are you ready?) Are you all set?

667
00:59:56,824 --> 01:00:00,191
ひらけ！！ 夢のトビラを (1 2 3)
Open up!! The door of dreams (1 2 3)

668
01:00:00,561 --> 01:00:02,341
アイまり準備はOK？
Are you ready? We're all set, OK?

669
01:00:03,213 --> 01:00:06,353
ひらけ!! 夢の ドビラを
Open the doors into our crazy dreams!

670
01:00:07,053 --> 01:00:09,333
1, 2, 3 キラメキライダー☆
(One, two, three, Kirameki Rider!)

671
01:00:10,361 --> 01:00:14,841
生まれたての ドドキを 響かせよう
Can you hear all our heartbeats echo for a brand-new start?

672
01:00:15,221 --> 01:00:20,361
最高の時間 最高の 仲間と
Anytime, anyplace, anyone can join on the fun.

673
01:00:21,121 --> 01:00:25,961
ここにいるよ 見つけてくれたから
Now we're here, and you found me where I belong.

674
01:00:26,781 --> 01:00:30,361
きみに 会いたくて やってきたんだ
That's why I came here to see you.

675
01:00:30,641 --> 01:00:32,621
みんなで歌おう
Sing it together now,

676
01:00:32,821 --> 01:00:37,961
終わらない メロディ キラメキに 乗って☆
A never-ending melody, riding on the sparkles...

677
01:00:38,321 --> 01:00:38,961
イエーイ
Yay!

678
01:00:49,206 --> 01:00:52,706
届いてるかな? 私の声
Now I wonder if my voice will reach you in the end?

679
01:00:53,206 --> 01:00:58,056
きっと 届きたいのは きみに笑顔
What can I do to see a smile from a friend?

680
01:00:58,406 --> 01:01:04,406
すこしでも 理想 の 音さに くやしくて
Though the ideal is oh so far out of reach,

681
01:01:05,356 --> 01:01:08,756
みうな とき は 笑ったね
We cried and laughed all of the pain away.

682
01:01:09,356 --> 01:01:15,106
ぎゅっと ぎゅっと ぎゅっと ぎゅっと すべて抱きしめて
Never ever, ever letting go, holding all of it close.

683
01:01:15,356 --> 01:01:18,156
いっしょに行こう どこまでも
Let's go wherever we want, you and me.

684
01:01:18,356 --> 01:01:20,656
アイまり準備は OK?
Yeah, we're all set, okay?

685
01:01:21,256 --> 01:01:24,656
すすめ!! 希望 の 道を
Let's walk the road to hope where we belong.

686
01:01:25,306 --> 01:01:28,056
1, 2, 3 キラメキライダー☆
(One, two, three, Kirameki Rider!)

687
01:01:28,356 --> 01:01:33,056
好きな気持ち カラフルに 奏でたいな
Every color you see in the rainbow you can use to paint your dream.

688
01:01:33,456 --> 01:01:38,056
最高の場所 最高の みんな と
Anytime, any place, anyone can join the team.

689
01:01:39,206 --> 01:01:44,456
ここにいるよ 幻 なんかじゃない
I'm right here, this is not an illusion.

690
01:01:45,206 --> 01:01:50,106
きみのココロ が 幸せに染まるように
Turning your heart into a million colors, see all the joy you make.

691
01:01:50,306 --> 01:01:55,756
重ねてく ハーモニー キラメキ まとって☆
Like when we layer harmonies, wrapped in sparkles...

692
01:01:56,306 --> 01:02:01,756
歌い続けたいな 踊り続けたいな
Maybe I can keep on singing, maybe I can keep on dancing.

693
01:02:02,356 --> 01:02:06,756
そんな願い や ワガママも いいでしょ?
Grant me this one wish 'cause sometimes I want what I want.

694
01:02:07,356 --> 01:02:13,806
だって 楽しすぎて もトまらない 輝く ステージ で
Praying all this fun we're having, it will never end and shine forevermore.

695
01:02:14,306 --> 01:02:16,306
もっと もっと!
More and more!

696
01:02:16,306 --> 01:02:19,506
(お願い) ずっと! イエーイ
(Pretty please?) Forever! (Woah, yay)

697
